<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Contact GoodLeaders</title>

<style>
*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
    font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
}

body{
    background:#f4f7fb;
    color:#222;
    line-height:1.7;
}

header{
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1e40af,#2563eb);
    color:white;
    padding:35px 20px;
    text-align:center;
}

header h1{
    font-size:34px;
    margin-bottom:8px;
}

header p{
    font-size:18px;
}

nav{
    background:white;
    padding:14px;
    text-align:center;
    box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
}

nav a{
    color:#1e40af;
    text-decoration:none;
    margin:0 10px;
    font-weight:bold;
}

nav a:hover{
    text-decoration:underline;
}

.container{
    max-width:950px;
    margin:35px auto;
    padding:0 20px;
}

.card{
    background:white;
    padding:30px;
    margin-bottom:22px;
    border-radius:15px;
    box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
}

h2{
    color:#1e40af;
    margin-bottom:14px;
}

p{
    margin-bottom:15px;
}

label{
    display:block;
    font-weight:bold;
    margin-bottom:6px;
}

input,
textarea{
    width:100%;
    padding:13px;
    margin-bottom:18px;
    border:1px solid #ccc;
    border-radius:8px;
    font-size:16px;
}

textarea{
    min-height:150px;
    resize:vertical;
}

button{
    padding:13px 22px;
    background:#2563eb;
    color:white;
    border:none;
    border-radius:8px;
    font-size:16px;
    cursor:pointer;
}

button:hover{
    background:#1d4ed8;
}

.info{
    background:#eff6ff;
    border-left:5px solid #2563eb;
    padding:18px;
    border-radius:8px;
}

.btn{
    display:inline-block;
    margin:8px;
    padding:12px 20px;
    background:#2563eb;
    color:white;
    text-decoration:none;
    border-radius:8px;
}

.btn:hover{
    background:#1d4ed8;
}

footer{
    background:#1e40af;
    color:white;
    text-align:center;
    padding:30px 20px;
    margin-top:40px;
}

footer p{
    margin:5px;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <h1>📩 Contact GoodLeaders</h1>
    <p>We would love to hear from you.</p>
</header>

<nav>
    <a href="/">Home</a>
    <a href="/about">About</a>
    <a href="/library">Library</a>
    <a href="/announcements">Announcements</a>
    <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
</nav>

<div class="container">

<div class="card">

<h2>💬 Get In Touch</h2>

<p>
Have a question, suggestion, feedback or message for the
GoodLeaders team? You can contact us using the form below.
</p>

<form action="/contact" method="POST">

<label for="name">Name</label>

<input
    type="text"
    id="name"
    name="name"
    placeholder="Enter your name"
    required>

<label for="email">Email</label>

<input
    type="email"
    id="email"
    name="email"
    placeholder="Enter your email address"
    required>

<label for="message">Message</label>

<textarea
    id="message"
    name="message"
    placeholder="Write your message here..."
    required></textarea>

<button type="submit">
    📨 Send Message
</button>

</form>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>📧 Contact Information</h2>

<p>
For questions about GoodLeaders, our educational resources,
leadership articles, library materials or website features,
please use the contact form above.
</p>

<div class="info">

<strong>💡 Suggestions and Feedback</strong>

<p>
Your feedback can help us improve GoodLeaders and make the
platform more useful for visitors and members.
</p>

<strong>📚 Resource Questions</strong>

<p>
If you have questions about resources available through the
GoodLeaders library, you can also contact us using the form.
</p>

</div>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>🤝 What You Can Contact Us About</h2>

<ul style="padding-left:25px;">
    <li>Questions about GoodLeaders</li>
    <li>Suggestions for improving the platform</li>
    <li>Feedback about website features</li>
    <li>Questions about library resources</li>
    <li>Leadership and educational content</li>
    <li>Reporting a problem with the website</li>
</ul>

</div>

<div style="text-align:center;">

<a href="/" class="btn">🏠 Home</a>
<a href="/about" class="btn">ℹ️ About Us</a>
<a href="/library" class="btn">📚 Library</a>

</div>

</div>

<footer>

<p><strong>GoodLeaders Platform</strong></p>

<p>Empowering Tomorrow's Leaders.</p>

<p>&copy; 2026 GoodLeaders. All Rights Reserved.</p>

</footer>

</body>
</html>
